    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d103">

                <pb facs="0185" n="178" xml:id="pg178"/>

                <head>No. 103.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Baker to Mr. Gresham.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Managua</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1894-08-30"><hi rendition="#italic">August 30,
                        1894</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Your cable has been received. I presented your demand promptly. The United States
                    citizens have been already expelled from Nicaragua without; charges or without
                    trial. In spite of my protest Americans marked for arbitrary expulsion. Awaiting
                    your instructions.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
